{"version":1,"content":"<p>【高招！</p><p>】Marketing 唔一定要「使大錢」！</p><p>適逢萬聖節假期，Tesla 再次展現獨特的科技行銷創意。</p><p>有民眾目擊 Tesla 全自動駕駛的士「Cybercab」以無人駕駛模式穿梭於市區道路，車內乘客座上竟端坐著兩具繫著安全帶的「骷髏骨架」道具，詭譎又吸睛的畫面隨即在社交平台上引發熱烈討論。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:09.753701+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T15:19:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.875830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.065537+00:00","content_hash":"80c63cc69518ff7f04f66a5ac090a5e9aa71120e8a029a4faef6ecb98e963e50","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}